{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Farm Supply Simulator 25 Demo </strong>is a realistic and detailed farming simulation that gives players the opportunity to run a farm market as well as plan and manage organic fertilizer processes.  <br> <br>\ud83c\udf3e\ud83d\udc51 <strong>Build Your Agricultural Supply Empire!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfea <strong>Start with a small shop</strong>, stock your shelves, and provide farmers with the products they need. <br>\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Scale up production:</strong> Produce with organic fertilizer machines and earn income.   <br> <br>\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Fully Dynamic Production</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc1b <strong>Organic Alternatives:</strong> Manure, Compost, Worm Castings<br><br>\ud83c\udfe6 <strong>Realistic Economy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage banking, loans, staff assignments, bill payments, economic crises, and expansion investments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf1e\ud83c\udf19 Day-night cycles, and multiple save slots put your strategies to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude9a <strong>Enhancements:</strong> Connect warehouses, stores, and labs. Buy new warehouses, stores, and production facilities. <br> <br>\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Get to the Top of the Agriculture World!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this strategy-rich, informative simulator, manage everything from your store to your fields, outpace your competitors, and reach the summit! </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3832110?t=1751482121","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832110/c4c00b2cfa5cab222843ed4e68b9cdf07b338d21/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751482121","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832110/9f57b1b456dd42ed16c748b23e780a517b7ba40b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751482121","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai